AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Ramesh Kumar, S/o Shri Bhanwar Lal, aged 48 years,
residing at 5, Sector 4, Hiran Magri, Udaipur – 313 001,
Civil Engineering Consultant,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am a qualified Civil Engineer with 25 years of experience in infrastructure projects
   and have been engaged as a consultant by M/s. Green Landscape Developers Pvt. Ltd. for the
   Integrated Township Landscaping Project.

2. I have personally inspected the construction site on multiple occasions and have
   reviewed all technical drawings, road construction records, and quality compliance.

3. Regarding the internal roads: The project includes 28 km of internal roads within the
   township. These roads were part of the original scope.

4. Regarding the scope creep: The additional 65 acres area also includes internal road
   construction for the new areas (lakefront, green belt, community park). This additional
   road construction was not part of the original scope.

5. The rate analysis prepared by my office shows that the fair compensation for the
   additional internal road construction is included in the ₹2.84 Crore scope creep claim.

6. Regarding quality of road work: I have personally inspected all internal roads constructed.
   The quality is fully compliant with:
   - CPWD Specifications 2021 for road construction
   - IS 15660:2006 (Pavement Quality Concrete)
   - MoRTH specifications for urban roads

7. Test certificates for all concrete samples show 100% compliance with target strength.
   No structural deficiencies have been identified in the road construction.

8. Regarding the delay in work: The scope creep (additional 65 acres) and water shortage
   (failure to provide irrigation infrastructure) caused significant delays in project completion.

9. The contractor executed the additional work for 65 acres based on verbal instructions
   from USCL Project Director. Per CPWD GCC Clause 12, work executed on Engineer's
   instructions is compensable even without formal Variation Order.

10. All facts stated above are within my professional knowledge and are true to the best of my
    information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Ramesh Kumar
Date: 01.10.2025
Place: Udaipur

